stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : save as draft (UC-16)
    DRAFT --> DRAFT : edit draft (UC-17)
    DRAFT --> ACTIVE : activate with no BLOCKING warning, within limits and validity (UC-18, BR-31, BR-62, BR-69)
    DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel (UC-19)
    ACTIVE --> EXECUTED : entry filled on a 1-minute candle, or MARKET and reached LIMIT at activation (NSF-07, BR-33)
    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : cancel (UC-19), or market disabled (BR-59)
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : expiry passed before the fill (NSF-09)
    ACTIVE --> INVALIDATED : invalidation level reached before the entry (BR-68)
    EXECUTED --> [*] : position continues in TRADING_JOURNAL (STM-05)
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    INVALIDATED --> [*]
